1
00:00:00,702 --> 00:00:04,392
4:40. The school just moved Mia's pickup to 5:15.

2
00:00:05,246 --> 00:00:06,819
Alex's train is late.

3
00:00:08,774 --> 00:00:11,289
One change. The whole evening comes apart.

4
00:00:12,595 --> 00:00:16,063
Relay Home rebuilds the evening. And it asks before it acts.

5
00:00:19,601 --> 00:00:25,825
[You] School moved Mia's pickup to 5:15 and Alex's train is late. Keep dinner under $8.

6
00:00:26,127 --> 00:00:29,042
Who may collect Mia. What dinner fits.

7
00:00:29,359 --> 00:00:31,051
[Relay] Jo can pick up Mia by 5:00 PM.

8
00:00:31,233 --> 00:00:35,905
[Relay] For dinner, Sam can make chickpea and tomato soup at 6:10 PM using only pantry items,

9
00:00:36,086 --> 00:00:37,304
[Relay] so it costs nothing.

10
00:00:37,486 --> 00:00:38,677
[Relay] Shall I ask Jo?

11
00:00:40,975 --> 00:00:42,542
Four adults. One deadline.

12
00:00:42,944 --> 00:00:46,651
Not on the school list: never suggested.

13
00:00:48,722 --> 00:00:49,426
[You] Ask Jo

14
00:00:51,154 --> 00:00:55,043
[Relay] Ask Jo to collect Mia at Oakfield School, main gate by 5:15 PM?

15
00:00:55,627 --> 00:00:56,118
[You] Yes.

16
00:00:58,142 --> 00:01:01,808
A private link, for Jo alone.

17
00:01:01,989 --> 00:01:05,090
[Relay] I have asked Jo to pick up Mia, and they are awaiting reply.

18
00:01:06,291 --> 00:01:07,985
Jo's phone. One question.

19
00:01:14,717 --> 00:01:15,833
[Relay] Jo confirmed.

20
00:01:16,015 --> 00:01:17,259
[Relay] The pickup is covered.

21
00:01:19,121 --> 00:01:21,204
[You] Make the pasta and order what we need.

22
00:01:21,507 --> 00:01:24,317
The pasta needs spinach. Relay gets a price.

23
00:01:24,499 --> 00:01:27,141
[Relay] Buy spinach from Corner Market (simulated) for $3.20?

24
00:01:27,322 --> 00:01:29,475
[Relay] Collect at the shop from 5:45 PM.

25
00:01:30,057 --> 00:01:30,548
[You] Yes.

26
00:01:35,853 --> 00:01:38,261
[Relay] Jo has confirmed the pickup for 5:15 PM.

27
00:01:38,440 --> 00:01:40,864
[Relay] I have ordered spinach for $3.20, and

28
00:01:41,046 --> 00:01:44,434
[Relay] Sam will make tomato and chickpea pasta starting at 6:05 PM.

29
00:01:44,735 --> 00:01:46,000
The evening, rebuilt.

30
00:01:47,204 --> 00:01:48,417
What if Jo says no?

31
00:01:52,867 --> 00:01:56,605
[Relay] Call the school or an approved adult; Relay will not suggest anyone else.

32
00:01:56,907 --> 00:01:58,502
It stops. It names no one.

33
00:01:59,834 --> 00:02:01,518
One yes, on the wire.

34
00:02:01,818 --> 00:02:05,666
The server asks. The answer is sealed to the question.

35
00:02:05,967 --> 00:02:08,396
Jo's phone answers the server itself.

36
00:02:09,399 --> 00:02:12,905
The same server, driven by a Strands agent.

37
00:02:15,507 --> 00:02:17,780
Relay Home. It asks before it acts.
